        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86475, Transitional Heritage Westwood Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Transitional Heritage Westwood Pull comes with everything you'll need to install it on any light weight cabinet or furniture door or drawer. It is available in 4 sizes: 3-1/2 inches, 4 inches, 6 inches, and 8 inches. The Westwood Cabinet Pull has a beautiful, very now look, perfect for transitional decors, which blend modern and traditional styles. This cabinet handle is available in a wide array of popular finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Emtek Westwood Cabinet Handles:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86475-specifications.gif?v=1704354771\" width=\"600\" height=\"134\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek 86475 specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 4 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-86475:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86476:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86477:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86478:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 8-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
